LaunchProbeOperation.description=Launch a probe from Earth, or from an owned Tier 1 factory and Tier 1 dock on the same hab to reduce Boost use. A space body must be prospected before building a base there.
FoundPlatformOperation.description=Build a small station core in the selected orbit. Buy and launch it from Earth, or use an owned factory-dock pair in any system. Requires at least {0} free {1}.
FoundAutomatedPlatformOperation.description=Build a small robotic station core. Buy and launch it from Earth, or use an owned factory-dock pair in any system. Requires at least {0} free {1}.
FoundOrbitalOperation.description=Build a large station core in the selected orbit. Buy and launch it from Earth, or use an owned matching-tier factory-dock pair in any system. Requires at least {0} free {1} and a space object able to support Tier 2 habs.
FoundRingOperation.description=Build a huge station core in the selected orbit. Buy and launch it from Earth, or use an owned matching-tier factory-dock pair in any system. Requires at least {0} free {1} and a space object able to support Tier 3 habs.
FoundOutpostOperation.description=Build a small base core at the selected site. Buy and launch it from Earth, or use an owned factory-dock pair in any system. Requires at least {0} free {1}.
FoundAutomatedOutpostOperation.description=Build a small robotic base core. Buy and launch it from Earth, or use an owned factory-dock pair in any system. Requires at least {0} free {1}.
FoundSettlementOperation.description=Build a large base core at the selected site. Buy and launch it from Earth, or use an owned matching-tier factory-dock pair in any system. Requires at least {0} free {1} and a space body large enough to support Tier 2 habs.
FoundColonyOperation.description=Build a huge base core at the selected site. Buy and launch it from Earth, or use an owned matching-tier factory-dock pair in any system. Requires at least {0} free {1} and a space body large enough to support Tier 3 habs.
